     3347   on start-search, ctrl-o of br-sht-hist in frame Dialog-Frame do:
     3348      run sort-brbr-sht-hist
     3349        (input (if available X_c-sht-hist
     3350                then recid(X_c-sht-hist)
     3351                else ?
